---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>YesHello</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Yes Hello!</h1>
      <img src="/images/me-waving.png" alt="Me saying hello" />
	  <span class="scroll-hint">↓</span>

    </section>
	    <!-- SECTION 2: Why say hello -->
    <section class="message-section">
      <p class="tagline">
        Say hello *AND* follow it up with what you want to chat about.
        <br/>Saying hello is okay! Saying hello is cool
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 3: Slack screenshots -->
    <section class="screenshots">
	<h2>Connect with conversations</h2>
      <div class="screenshot-grid">
        <img src="/images/slack-message1.png" alt="Another Slack conversation saying hello" />
		<img src="/images/slack-message2.png" alt="Slack conversation saying hello" />

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 4: Small talk message -->
    <section class="message-section">
      <p class="wisdom">
        Making small talk is good. It helps maintain the social fabric.<br />
        You won't remember the tickets you solved on your deathbed, but your interactions with people. 
		<br/>Obviously it is not that deep, but yeah say hello.
      </p>
    </section>

	    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer>
      Made with ♥ by mumtaz
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>